  "question": {
    "text": "Monochromatic light is incident on a glass prism of angle A. If the refractive index of the material of the prism is <math><mi>&#956;</mi></math> , a ray, incident at an angle <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math> , on the face AB would get transmitted through the face AC of the prism provided:<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0220_297b2c712a29.png\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 178px;\" />"
